-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Cranberry, Raspberry, Hawthorn fruit, Dark Plum\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          入口是红色花香和蔓越莓、红布林的果酸，在嘴里随后咀嚼时会有淡淡的树莓果香出来，随着温度降低，红色的核果像李子、杏类还有乌梅的酸甜会浮现出来，尾韵也很乌梅，还有一些西梅的甜~然后我看了一眼生豆伙伴的描述 ：山楂，唉，有哦！；\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：水洗 Washed\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          建议养豆：2周\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味描述：蔓越莓干、蓝莓干、花香、茶香\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Dried cranberry, Dried blue berry, Floral, Tea-like\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这只SL28水洗很奇特，王老师杯测回来说测到一只很顶的SL28，有花香，比一些瑰夏都好喝，我就很期待，拿到大货炒了一锅，没喝到，然后王老师又调整曲线又炒了一锅，还是没有...略过2个星期的反复测试，上大机器又搞了一锅；11.2号的批次，这几天冲发现开始出风味了，入口是很莓果干，我第一反应是以前吃过不知道谁买的放办公室没人吃的长白山蓝莓干，太像了，还有蔓越莓的果干那种酸甜酸甜的（东北的蔓越莓果子是很酸的一点都不甜的，所以最近几个月的风味描述里看到蔓越莓的是那种酸香，这只是果干是那种加过糖腌渍的果干），然后咀嚼中会出现一些淡淡的不可名状的花香和茶香，我不想在用茉莉绿茶呀，洋甘菊呀去形容他了，就用茶香吧～等你们喝到了感受下\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n<br/>\n          ‍‍\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SZqrKNOK6ctgrqbUur2qW1ico97pPiaPjt5x7icibrGXiakav7PpjmKMoangBZoQIWfauIWgmyqJ9F4Hw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于 无限农场\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<span style='font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;'>\n          无限庄园位于哥斯达黎加的西部山谷West Valley的西部山谷的橙树镇（我翻译的哈哈），曾经名字叫做Sin Limites（西班牙语无限的意思），2024年由于运营管理因素，对外销售改名为Infinity，现在由Jaime和Maribel夫妻两人共同管理经营；（还查到一个国外烘焙商的资料是庄园名字还是Sin Limites，Infinity是位于庄园里的处理站的名字，可能是这个原因对外习惯都用处理站Micro Mill的名字来推广）；\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T4x2xyib29FcWYZQ489qVicterI5Xjc2ccNrIgDuibSWbxDknkp7RibetEJU23MQictkUdxXbxgmSNu8A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T4x2xyib29FcWYZQ489qVictAV3nib60A97Ozglbeg2mSOn6xpW41x7KuPW4m51aBZerYDzNPcH61gQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n          CoE官网2019年赛事里无限提交的照片，估计是Jaime小朋友其中的一个，现在应该长大很多了吧～\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n          ‍\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<span style='font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<span style='font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;'>\n          Maribel来自哥斯达黎加非常知名的咖啡家族\n          <span style='outline: 0px;font-family: myriad-pro, \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n           Barrantes（Herbazu庄园的家族），Jaime是一个特别钻研咖啡，尤其是加工处理的咖农；2006年，Maribel从家族里继承了庄园，同时在Jaime的规划下，也同步建立了湿处理和脱壳干处理的全套设施，这样从种植，采收，加工处理到脱壳全部的过程都可以自己管控完成；\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T4x2xyib29FcWYZQ489qVictzNlwrbg73mA9zzIYw5xE25822Bltvnib5OCAxqQHryaEoAr8KmvNVaA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;'>\n<span style='font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: 14px;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: myriad-pro, \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;fon