e-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='font-family: myriad-pro, \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;'>\n          2021 CoE #27 / #28\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;\">\n<span style='font-family: myriad-pro, \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;'>\n          2023 CoE #19/ #21 / #23\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: start;margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: myriad-pro, \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 16px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于San Roque品种\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          从国外的一些文章上查到的资料，在哥斯达黎加San Roque, San Roque Kenia或者Kenia，又或者SL都说的是同一个品种，就是肯尼亚种，San Roque是西部山谷附近一个地名，所以多少可能它的起源与San Roque这个地方有一定的关系。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          无限农场的农场主夫人\n          <span style=\"caret-color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75);color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75);font-family: Prompt, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.6px;text-align: start;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\n           Maibel\n          </span>\n          ，就是Herbazu家族的，所以无限农场里种植的肯尼亚品种也是从Herbazu引种过来的；\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          而对于Herbazu，之前查到的信息是，2015年\n          <span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           Herbazu旗下庄园Leoncio第一次提交这个品种去参赛CoE并获得了第一名\n          </span>\n          ，Square Mile的生豆采购正好时当年的国际评审，她所了解到的信息发文中提到了Herbazu种植的肯尼亚种是2010年，Toino\n          <span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           在一个农艺师的协助下，一起从萨尔瓦多引种了75株\"San Roque Kenia“ 品种，其中有55株活了下来，成为了现在旗下农场的所有肯尼亚品种的母株。但当时参赛时的品种信息是SL28，而2021年从La Torre提交CoE的品种信息是San Roque，这里姑且就让我大胆的假设一把吧，他们就是一回事（逻辑很简单，因为庄园里已经有成熟的种植母株，没道理再去其它地方引种新的来种吧？）\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(178, 178, 178);'>\n           说明：关于San Roque的来源，目前没有查到很详实的来历，参考了Square Miles的生豆采购\n          </span>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(178, 178, 178);'>\n           Anette Moldvaer于\n          </span>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);color: rgb(178, 178, 178);'>\n           2015年发的一篇\n          </span>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://squaremileblog.com/2015/06/17/herbazu-2015/\" imgurl=\"\" linktype=\"text\" style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);cursor: default;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;' tab=\"outerlink\" target=\"_blank\" textvalue=\"日志\">\n           日志\n          </a>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);'>\n           ，我大胆的假设了在\n           <span style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n            Herbazú\n           </span>\n           旗下农场种植的肯尼亚品种 SL系列和San Roque为同一品种，如果后续有任何的资料纠正请不吝告知，谢谢！\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;visibility: visible;'>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;'>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.5em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n              公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n             </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.5em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n              客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n             </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T63dGPyUPjictQZLtFjiafuZfP6JRomfrYRJyo2D4Tf0NvibBUZu9UP4VMYvReaLlu6bc42JoO24QdA/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;width: 578px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
